<title>USA: Great Western Bank to buy subordinated notes.</title>
<headline>Great Western Bank to buy subordinated notes.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Western Bank, a subsidiary of Great Western Financial Corp, said it will offer to buy two of its issues of subordinated notes with a total amount outstanding of $280 million.</p>
<p>The notes are 10-1/4 percent due 2000 and 10-1/2 percent due 2000. The tender offer is open from November 18 to December 4 unless extended, the bank said.</p>
</text>
